    <briefdescription>
<para>Type storing dependency information for one data item, including the data type. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>&lt;tt&gt;T&lt;/tt&gt;</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The user-level type involved (e.g. <computeroutput>slice&lt;double&gt;</computeroutput> or <computeroutput>slice&lt;const double&gt;</computeroutput> for a contiguous array). Note that <computeroutput>T</computeroutput> may be different in <computeroutput>const</computeroutput> qualifiers than the actual type stored in the dependency information. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
